e space attention for ML models. Addresses computational efficiency in attention mechanisms. Code available.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18580\" target=\"_blank\">arXiv</a>\n                        <br>\n                        2026-04-21\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18574\" target=\"_blank\">LLMs Reasoning with Weak Supervision</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Paper investigating when LLMs can learn reasoning capabilities with weak supervision. Addresses fundamental questions about LLM training and reasoning development.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18574\" target=\"_blank\">arXiv</a>\n                        <br>\n                        2026-04-21\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18567\" target=\"_blank\">Latent Phase-Shift Rollback</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Novel approach for inference-time error correction in LLMs through residual stream monitoring and KV-cache steering.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18567\" target=\"_blank\">arXiv</a>\n                        <br>\n                        2026-04-21\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18473\" target=\"_blank\">Modular Post-Training with MoE</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Research on modular post-training with mixture-of-experts. Proposes training separate modules and merging them.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18473\" target=\"_blank\">arXiv</a>\n                        <br>\n                        2026-04-21\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18419\" target=\"_blank\">Dynamic Abstention in LLM Reasoning</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Framework for knowing when LLM should refrain from answering. Addresses reliability and calibration issues in LLM outputs.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18419\" target=\"_blank\">arXiv</a>\n                        <br>\n                        2026-04-21\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18584\" target=\"_blank\">MathNet: Multimodal Math Benchmark</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">New benchmark for mathematical reasoning and retrieval using multimodal approaches. ICLR 2026 paper.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18584\" target=\"_blank\">arXiv</a>\n                        <br>\n                        2026-04-21\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18576\" target=\"_blank\">Agentic Forecasting</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Paper on agentic forecasting using sequential Bayesian updating of linguistic beliefs. Addresses how AI agents can update beliefs and make forecasts.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18576\" target=\"_blank\">arXiv</a>\n                        <br>\n                        2026-04-21\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18543\" target=\"_blank\">ClawEnvKit</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Framework for automatic environment generation for Claw-like agents (similar to OpenClaw). Addresses agent testing and environment synthesis.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18543\" target=\"_blank\">arXiv</a>\n                        <br>\n                        2026-04-21\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18519\" target=\"_blank\">LLM Safety From Within</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Research on detecting harmful content using LLM internal representations rather than external filters. Addresses AI safety through internal monitoring.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        <a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18519\" target=\"_blank\">arXiv</a>\n                        <br>\n                        2026-04-21\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"item\">\n                    <div class=\"item-title\"><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2604.18478\" target=\"_blank\">WorldDB Memory Engine</a></div>\n                    <div class=\"item-description\">Novel memory engine using vector graph-of-worlds with ontology-aware reconciliation during writes. Addresses persistent memory and knowledge representation for AI agents.</div>\n                    <div class=\"item-meta\">\n                        